================================================================================
                          CIPHERBOX PQC WASM
================================================================================

             WebAssembly bindings for cipherbox-pqc-core:
             ML-KEM-768/1024, ML-DSA-65/87, X25519 hybrid,
             chunked file encryption, Argon2id + ChaCha20-Poly1305,
             and secret-derived rooms.

                          Version 0.7.0  |  MIT License
                          Status: UNAUDITED. See top-level README.

================================================================================
