================================================================================

  1.  What This Crate Is
  2.  Installation
  3.  Identity: Key Pairs
  4.  Encapsulation
  5.  Wrapping a Key for a User
  6.  Hybrid Keys
  7.  Files: One-Shot and Streaming
  8.  Secret-Derived Rooms
